="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">TV WALL MOUNT COMPATIBLITY: This Ultra slim TV wall mount fits for most of 37-90 inch LCD/LED/OLED TVs with VESA patterns 100x200 mm up to 600x400 mm and up to 165 lbs. Designed for installation on 12/16" wood studs, concrete, and brick walls. (Do not install the mount on drywall alone!) Perfect for TV installation in living room, kitchen, bedroom, office or any other place</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">ULTRA SLIM &amp; DISCREET DESIGN: This TV wall mount has been cleverly designed to retract to a mere 2.75 inches from the wall, ensuring a super slim profile that merges flawlessly with your living space. Its design leaves ample room for your creative home décor and with a velcro for cable management, all your cables are neatly organized and hidden, enhancing the neatness and elegance of your space</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">COMFORTABLE VIEWING EXPERIENCE: The monTEK full motion TV wall mount tilts +5°/-15° without tools to reduce glare, extend your TV 16.6″ from the wall and swivel +/-60° for dynamic adjustability to achieve an optimal viewing experience (note that maximum rotation depends on screen size). Level your screen +/-3° after installation to fine tune the TV's position</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">SECURE TV MOUNT: Choose our monTEK TV Wall Mount for reliable TV stability. With 6 tilt and swivel arms, enjoy smooth, optimal viewing angles. Capable of holding up to 165lbs, it's built from heavy-duty steel and features a durable faceplate and secure screws. Having passed a rigorous 4x max load test, this mount combines strong construction and articulating arms for unmatched safety</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">QUICK &amp; EASY INSTALLATION: DTV mount comes with decent instruction, bubble level and necessary hardware in pre-labeled bags for easier installation. Simply attach the TV brackets, mount the wall plate, then hang your TV. Designed for durability, this tv mount offers reliable after-sales service and technical support. Feel free to reach out with any queries</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product description</h2>    <div>
+                    【TV Mount Compatibility】- The TV MOUNT tv wall mount fits most 37-90 inch TVs and holds up to 165lbs of weight with MAX VESA 600 x 400mm supporting up to 12/16 inch wood stud spacing. Please check the VESA, TV weight, wood studs spacing, and possible blocked input for a better experience.【Space Saving】- Ultra slim TV wall mount offers a great space saving solution with a stylish appearance by placing the TV bracket 2.5 inches closer to the wall. Meanwhile, this large full motion TV mount can extend 25 inches for comfortable viewing.【Adjustable View Comfortable &amp; Glare reduction】- Our TV bracket with dual articulating arms includes +5°/-15° tilt, ±60° swivel (maximum swivel angle depends on your TV). All of these features will make your TV flexible, say goodbye to annoying glare, and allow for better viewing depending on your seating in the room.  </div>
+               </div>           <div id="pqv-newer-version" data-target="#newerVersion_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-newer-version-heading">Newer Version Available</h2>       <a class="a-spacing-small a-link-normal" href="/monTEK-Long-Motion-Mount-43-95/dp/B0H4PGK9QJ?ref=dp_product_quick_view">monTEK Long Arm Full Motion TV Wall Mount for 43-95 Inch TVs up to 150 lbs | 40 in extension with heavy-duty support, ±90° swivel, +5°/-15° tilt, max VESA 800x400mm, 16/18/24 in wood studs, preassembled</a>   <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <p class="a-spacing-none"> <span class="a-text-bold">$149.99</span> , 4.8 out of 5 stars,  426 ratings </p> <p class="a-spacing-none">In Stock</p> </div> </div>               <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-options-available">Options Available</h2>    <h3>Size</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 37-84" Full Motion TV Wall Mount </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 37-90" Full Motion TV Wall Mount </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> 37-90" Long Arm TV Wall Mount </span></li>  </ul>  <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-twister-action" data-pqv-twister-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-twister" data-target="#twister-plus-mobile-inline-twister,#twister_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#twister_feature_div"> Browse all available options </a> </span> </div>                              <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-report-issue-action" data-pqv-report-issue-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-report-issue" data-target="#tellAmazon_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#tellAmazon_feature_div"> Report an issue with this product or seller </a> </span> </div>                     <div id="pqv-feedback" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feedback-heading">Feedback</h2> <p>Did you find this product summary feature us